---
{
  title: "roomp"
}
---
### NAME

    roomp() - Determine if an object is a room or not.

### SYNOPSIS

    int roomp( object ob );

### DESCRIPTION

    Determine if an object is a room or not.

### PARAMETERS

    ob  (object)
        The object to test.

### RETURN VALUES

    (1 as STD_ROOM) 1 if the object is a room, otherwise 0.
